[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Hello and welcome to Real Easy English,",
    "start": 0.07,
    "end": 3.291,
    "zh": "你好，欢迎收听《简单英语》",
    "zh_hant": "你好，歡迎收聽《簡單英語》"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "the podcast where we have real conversations.",
    "start": 2.992,
    "end": 6.273,
    "zh": "这个播客里有真实的对话",
    "zh_hant": "這個播客裡有真實的對話"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "in easy English to help you learn.",
    "start": 6.153,
    "end": 8.614,
    "zh": "用简单的英语帮你学习",
    "zh_hant": "用簡單的英語幫你學習"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "I'm Neil, and with me is Georgie.",
    "start": 8.574,
    "end": 11.095,
    "zh": "我是尼尔，和我一起的是乔治",
    "zh_hant": "我是尼爾，和我一起的是喬治"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "Hello.",
    "start": 10.996,
    "end": 11.776,
    "zh": "你好",
    "zh_hant": "你好"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "Did you know that you can now watch a video of this podcast?",
    "start": 12.036,
    "end": 16.258,
    "zh": "你知道吗，现在可以观看这个播客的视频了",
    "zh_hant": "你知道嗎，現在可以觀看這個播客的影片了"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "And you can read along with a transcript on our website.",
    "start": 15.958,
    "end": 19.399,
    "zh": "你也可以在我们的网站上跟着文字稿阅读",
    "zh_hant": "你也可以在我們的網站上跟著文字稿閱讀"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "Visit bbclearningenglish.com.",
    "start": 19.36,
    "end": 22.261,
    "zh": "访问bbclearningenglish.com",
    "zh_hant": "訪問bbclearningenglish.com"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "Hi, Georgie.",
    "start": 27.764,
    "end": 28.804,
    "zh": "嗨，乔治",
    "zh_hant": "嗨，喬治"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "How are you?",
    "start": 28.454,
    "end": 29.284,
    "zh": "你好吗",
    "zh_hant": "你好嗎"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "I'm very well, thank you, Neil.",
    "start": 29.245,
    "end": 31.005,
    "zh": "我很好，谢谢，尼尔",
    "zh_hant": "我很好，謝謝，尼爾"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "How are you?",
    "start": 30.655,
    "end": 31.485,
    "zh": "你呢",
    "zh_hant": "你呢"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "How was your journey into work?",
    "start": 31.135,
    "end": 32.946,
    "zh": "你上班路上怎么样",
    "zh_hant": "你上班路上怎麼樣"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "My journey into work was very good today, actually.",
    "start": 32.846,
    "end": 36.028,
    "zh": "今天上班路上很顺利，实际上",
    "zh_hant": "今天上班路上很順利，實際上"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "And we're actually talking about transport today.",
    "start": 36.248,
    "end": 39.83,
    "zh": "我们今天正好在聊交通",
    "zh_hant": "我們今天正好在聊交通"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "How was your journey to work?",
    "start": 39.79,
    "end": 41.671,
    "zh": "你上班路上怎么样",
    "zh_hant": "你上班路上怎麼樣"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "My journey was quite easy this morning, actually.",
    "start": 41.771,
    "end": 44.872,
    "zh": "今天早上我上班路挺轻松的",
    "zh_hant": "今天早上我上班路挺輕鬆的"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "It isn't always.",
    "start": 44.733,
    "end": 46.133,
    "zh": "但并不是一直这样",
    "zh_hant": "但並不是一直這樣"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "And, Neil, we actually have a very similar commute, don't we?",
    "start": 46.253,
    "end": 49.295,
    "zh": "尼尔，其实我们通勤方式很相似，对吧",
    "zh_hant": "尼爾，其實我們通勤方式很相似，對吧"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "I get the Tube to work,",
    "start": 50.576,
    "end": 53.437,
    "zh": "我坐地铁上班",
    "zh_hant": "我坐地鐵上班"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "which in the UK is the underground train.",
    "start": 53.087,
    "end": 56.378,
    "zh": "在英国，地铁就是地下火车",
    "zh_hant": "在英國，地鐵就是地下火車"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "So I walk to the station around 15 to 20 minutes,",
    "start": 56.879,
    "end": 60.6,
    "zh": "我走大约15到20分钟到车站",
    "zh_hant": "我走大約15到20分鐘到車站"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "and then I get the underground train,",
    "start": 60.28,
    "end": 62.601,
    "zh": "然后坐地下火车",
    "zh_hant": "然後坐地下火車"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "one train, and then I change and then get another one,",
    "start": 63.042,
    "end": 66.143,
    "zh": "坐一趟，然后换乘另一趟",
    "zh_hant": "坐一趟，然後換乘另一趟"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "and then I walk to work.",
    "start": 66.543,
    "end": 67.904,
    "zh": "最后走到公司",
    "zh_hant": "最後走到公司"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "What about you?",
    "start": 68.024,
    "end": 68.944,
    "zh": "你呢",
    "zh_hant": "你呢"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "I do that, but before,",
    "start": 68.964,
    "end": 71.866,
    "zh": "我也是这样，但在此之前",
    "zh_hant": "我也是這樣，但在此之前"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "text": "your bit, I have to get a bus as well.",
    "start": 72.246,
    "end": 75.307,
    "zh": "在你说的那段之前，我还得先坐公交",
    "zh_hant": "在你說的那段之前，我還得先坐公交"
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "text": "Are you that far away from the station?",
    "start": 74.967,
    "end": 77.528,
    "zh": "你离车站那么远吗",
    "zh_hant": "你離車站那麼遠嗎"
  },
  {
    "index": 29,
    "text": "A couple of miles.",
    "start": 79.27,
    "end": 80.971,
    "zh": "两三英里",
    "zh_hant": "兩三英里"
  },
  {
    "index": 30,
    "text": "OK.",
    "start": 80.811,
    "end": 81.451,
    "zh": "哦",
    "zh_hant": "哦"
  },
  {
    "index": 31,
    "text": "Three kilometres.",
    "start": 81.771,
    "end": 83.032,
    "zh": "三公里",
    "zh_hant": "三公里"
  },
  {
    "index": 32,
    "text": "A bit too far to walk, then.",
    "start": 82.832,
    "end": 84.672,
    "zh": "那走过去有点远了",
    "zh_hant": "那走過去有點遠了"
  },
  {
    "index": 33,
    "text": "A bit too far to walk.",
    "start": 84.322,
    "end": 85.633,
    "zh": "确实有点远",
    "zh_hant": "確實有點遠"
  },
  {
    "index": 34,
    "text": "I have walked when the public transport has been unreliable.",
    "start": 85.473,
    "end": 89.795,
    "zh": "公共交通不准时的时候，我也走过",
    "zh_hant": "公共交通不準時的時候，我也走過"
  },
  {
    "index": 35,
    "text": "But normally I get the bus",
    "start": 90.696,
    "end": 93.277,
    "zh": "但通常我会坐公交",
    "zh_hant": "但通常我會坐公交"
  },
  {
    "index": 36,
    "text": "to the Tube stop,",
    "start": 93.617,
    "end": 95.578,
    "zh": "到地铁站",
    "zh_hant": "到地鐵站"
  },
  {
    "index": 37,
    "text": "and then I get on the Tube into work.",
    "start": 95.378,
    "end": 98.819,
    "zh": "然后坐地铁去上班",
    "zh_hant": "然後坐地鐵去上班"
  },
  {
    "index": 38,
    "text": "Lovely.",
    "start": 98.76,
    "end": 99.6,
    "zh": "那很好",
    "zh_hant": "那很好"
  },
  {
    "index": 39,
    "text": "And do you like the Tube?",
    "start": 99.42,
    "end": 101.121,
    "zh": "你喜欢地铁吗",
    "zh_hant": "你喜歡地鐵嗎"
  },
  {
    "index": 40,
    "text": "What do you think about it?",
    "start": 100.771,
    "end": 102.061,
    "zh": "你觉得怎么样",
    "zh_hant": "你覺得怎麼樣"
  },
  {
    "index": 41,
    "text": "I think the Tube is very convenient, actually,",
    "start": 102.942,
    "end": 106.703,
    "zh": "我觉得地铁其实很方便",
    "zh_hant": "我覺得地鐵其實很方便"
  },
  {
    "index": 42,
    "text": "because the trains go very frequently.",
    "start": 106.864,
    "end": 110.365,
    "zh": "因为班次很频繁",
    "zh_hant": "因為班次很頻繁"
  },
  {
    "index": 43,
    "text": "So if you miss one, you can wait just a couple of minutes and get",
    "start": 110.265,
    "end": 114.507,
    "zh": "所以如果错过一趟，只需等几分钟",
    "zh_hant": "所以如果錯過一趟，只需等幾分鐘"
  },
  {
    "index": 44,
    "text": "the next one.",
    "start": 114.187,
    "end": 115.287,
    "zh": "就能坐下一趟",
    "zh_hant": "就能坐下一趟"
  },
  {
    "index": 45,
    "text": "And it's probably the quickest way to get",
    "start": 116.788,
    "end": 120.15,
    "zh": "而且可能是最快的到达方式",
    "zh_hant": "而且可能是最快的到達方式"
  },
  {
    "index": 46,
    "text": "into central London",
    "start": 120.131,
    "end": 121.851,
    "zh": "进入伦敦市中心",
    "zh_hant": "進入倫敦市中心"
  },
  {
    "index": 47,
    "text": "because there's so much traffic.",
    "start": 121.691,
    "end": 124.412,
    "zh": "因为车太多了",
    "zh_hant": "因為車太多了"
  },
  {
    "index": 48,
    "text": "Driving is a really bad idea.",
    "start": 124.062,
    "end": 126.373,
    "zh": "开车绝对不是一个好主意",
    "zh_hant": "開車絕對不是一個好主意"
  },
  {
    "index": 49,
    "text": "Yeah, I agree with you.",
    "start": 127.574,
    "end": 129.535,
    "zh": "是的，我同意",
    "zh_hant": "是的，我同意"
  },
  {
    "index": 50,
    "text": "It is very reliable .",
    "start": 129.455,
    "end": 131.17,
    "zh": "它很可靠",
    "zh_hant": "它很可靠"
  },
  {
    "index": 51,
    "text": "It's usually very easy.",
    "start": 131.116,
    "end": 132.897,
    "zh": "通常很方便",
    "zh_hant": "通常很方便"
  },
  {
    "index": 52,
    "text": "The thing I don't like about it, especially in the morning",
    "start": 132.937,
    "end": 136.559,
    "zh": "我不喜欢的是，特别是在早上",
    "zh_hant": "我不喜歡的是，特別是在早上"
  },
  {
    "index": 53,
    "text": "at rush hour,",
    "start": 136.299,
    "end": 137.599,
    "zh": "高峰时段",
    "zh_hant": "高峰時段"
  },
  {
    "index": 54,
    "text": "is the number of people on the Tube.",
    "start": 138.06,
    "end": 141.301,
    "zh": "地铁上人特别多",
    "zh_hant": "地鐵上人特別多"
  },
  {
    "index": 55,
    "text": "The, the underground trains in London",
    "start": 140.951,
    "end": 144.382,
    "zh": "伦敦的地下火车",
    "zh_hant": "倫敦的地下火車"
  },
  {
    "index": 56,
    "text": "are very old.",
    "start": 144.032,
    "end": 145.783,
    "zh": "很旧",
    "zh_hant": "很舊"
  },
  {
    "index": 57,
    "text": "They're very small.",
    "start": 145.963,
    "end": 147.504,
    "zh": "很小",
    "zh_hant": "很小"
  },
  {
    "index": 58,
    "text": "And they are very crowded in the mornings.",
    "start": 147.444,
    "end": 151.706,
    "zh": "早上非常拥挤",
    "zh_hant": "早上非常擁擠"
  },
  {
    "index": 59,
    "text": "So crowded means there's lots of people.",
    "start": 151.486,
    "end": 153.967,
    "zh": "拥挤就是人很多",
    "zh_hant": "擁擠就是人很多"
  },
  {
    "index": 60,
    "text": "We can also say packed .",
    "start": 154.568,
    "end": 157.15,
    "zh": "我们也可以说拥挤不堪",
    "zh_hant": "我們也可以說擁擠不堪"
  },
  {
    "index": 61,
    "text": "Yeah.",
    "start": 157.569,
    "end": 158.209,
    "zh": "对",
    "zh_hant": "對"
  },
  {
    "index": 62,
    "text": "And I really don't like being in a tight space",
    "start": 157.859,
    "end": 161.792,
    "zh": "我真的不喜欢挤在狭小空间里",
    "zh_hant": "我真的不喜歡擠在狹小空間裡"
  },
  {
    "index": 63,
    "text": "with lots of people",
    "start": 161.442,
    "end": 162.812,
    "zh": "和很多人一起",
    "zh_hant": "和很多人一起"
  },
  {
    "index": 64,
    "text": "in the mornings, so early in the morning.",
    "start": 162.462,
    "end": 164.853,
    "zh": "在早上，这么早的时候",
    "zh_hant": "在早上，這麼早的時候"
  },
  {
    "index": 65,
    "text": "Yeah, I agree,",
    "start": 165.053,
    "end": 166.674,
    "zh": "是的，我同意",
    "zh_hant": "是的，我同意"
  },
  {
    "index": 66,
    "text": "but I'm lucky because I get on the Tube at the first stop,",
    "start": 166.324,
    "end": 170.316,
    "zh": "但我很幸运，因为我在始发站上车",
    "zh_hant": "但我很幸運，因為我在始發站上車"
  },
  {
    "index": 67,
    "text": "so I always get a seat, but then",
    "start": 169.966,
    "end": 172.857,
    "zh": "所以总有座位，但然后",
    "zh_hant": "所以總有座位，但然後"
  },
  {
    "index": 68,
    "text": "by the time you get on,",
    "start": 172.777,
    "end": 174.498,
    "zh": "等你上车的时候",
    "zh_hant": "等你上車的時候"
  },
  {
    "index": 69,
    "text": "it is usually really packed .",
    "start": 174.158,
    "end": 177.01,
    "zh": "通常已经很挤了",
    "zh_hant": "通常已經很擠了"
  },
  {
    "index": 70,
    "text": "And the closer you get into central London,",
    "start": 177.079,
    "end": 180.06,
    "zh": "而且越靠近伦敦市中心",
    "zh_hant": "而且越靠近倫敦市中心"
  },
  {
    "index": 71,
    "text": "the more packed it is.",
    "start": 179.801,
    "end": 181.581,
    "zh": "就越挤",
    "zh_hant": "就越擠"
  },
  {
    "index": 72,
    "text": "You're squashed up against strangers.",
    "start": 181.702,
    "end": 183.842,
    "zh": "你会被挤在陌生人中间",
    "zh_hant": "你會被擠在陌生人中間"
  },
  {
    "index": 73,
    "text": "It's not always fun.",
    "start": 184.103,
    "end": 185.543,
    "zh": "并不总是那么愉快",
    "zh_hant": "並不總是那麼愉快"
  },
  {
    "index": 74,
    "text": "I hate it.",
    "start": 185.463,
    "end": 186.464,
    "zh": "我讨厌这样",
    "zh_hant": "我討厭這樣"
  },
  {
    "index": 75,
    "text": "What about buses?",
    "start": 186.264,
    "end": 187.464,
    "zh": "那公交呢",
    "zh_hant": "那公交呢"
  },
  {
    "index": 76,
    "text": "Do you like buses?",
    "start": 187.114,
    "end": 190.606,
    "zh": "你喜欢公交吗",
    "zh_hant": "你喜歡公交嗎"
  },
  {
    "index": 77,
    "text": "are OK.",
    "start": 190.256,
    "end": 190.926,
    "zh": "还可以",
    "zh_hant": "還可以"
  },
  {
    "index": 78,
    "text": "They, in London again, they are quite frequent .",
    "start": 192.507,
    "end": 195.91,
    "zh": "在伦敦，公交班次也相当频繁",
    "zh_hant": "在倫敦，公交班次也相當頻繁"
  },
  {
    "index": 79,
    "text": "And that's convenient.",
    "start": 196.429,
    "end": 197.969,
    "zh": "那很方便",
    "zh_hant": "那很方便"
  },
  {
    "index": 80,
    "text": "Not always.",
    "start": 198.05,
    "end": 199.35,
    "zh": "但也不总是",
    "zh_hant": "但也不總是"
  },
  {
    "index": 81,
    "text": "I mean, they are, they're",
    "start": 199.0,
    "end": 200.571,
    "zh": "我的意思是，它们是",
    "zh_hant": "我的意思是，它們是"
  },
  {
    "index": 82,
    "text": "frequent , but they're more unreliable than trains, aren't they?",
    "start": 200.221,
    "end": 204.613,
    "zh": "频繁，但不如火车可靠，对吧",
    "zh_hant": "頻繁，但不如火車可靠，對吧"
  },
  {
    "index": 83,
    "text": "There always seems to be roadworks near where I live,",
    "start": 204.453,
    "end": 207.975,
    "zh": "我家附近好像总有道路施工",
    "zh_hant": "我家附近好像總有道路施工"
  },
  {
    "index": 84,
    "text": "and when there are roadworks,",
    "start": 207.935,
    "end": 210.496,
    "zh": "一有道路施工",
    "zh_hant": "一有道路施工"
  },
  {
    "index": 85,
    "text": "there are traffic lights and then there are delays on the buses.",
    "start": 210.146,
    "end": 213.617,
    "zh": "就有红绿灯，然后公交就延误",
    "zh_hant": "就有紅綠燈，然後公交就延誤"
  },
  {
    "index": 86,
    "text": "So in the city, public transport",
    "start": 214.538,
    "end": 218.16,
    "zh": "所以在城市里，公共交通",
    "zh_hant": "所以在城市裡，公共交通"
  },
  {
    "index": 87,
    "text": "can be great.",
    "start": 218.0,
    "end": 219.16,
    "zh": "可以很好",
    "zh_hant": "可以很好"
  },
  {
    "index": 88,
    "text": "But what about when we go outside of the city?",
    "start": 218.98,
    "end": 222.222,
    "zh": "但出了城呢",
    "zh_hant": "但出了城呢"
  },
  {
    "index": 89,
    "text": "What do you use to go to other parts of the UK?",
    "start": 222.802,
    "end": 227.124,
    "zh": "你去英国其他地方用什么交通工具",
    "zh_hant": "你去英國其他地方用什麼交通工具"
  },
  {
    "index": 90,
    "text": "If it's quite far,",
    "start": 228.005,
    "end": 230.025,
    "zh": "如果很远的话",
    "zh_hant": "如果很遠的話"
  },
  {
    "index": 91,
    "text": "so if I'm going really far north,",
    "start": 229.705,
    "end": 232.006,
    "zh": "比如我要去很北的地方",
    "zh_hant": "比如我要去很北的地方"
  },
  {
    "index": 92,
    "text": "maybe to Scotland or to, I don't know,",
    "start": 231.907,
    "end": 235.268,
    "zh": "可能去苏格兰或者，我不知道",
    "zh_hant": "可能去蘇格蘭或者，我不知道"
  },
  {
    "index": 93,
    "text": "Manchester or a northern city,",
    "start": 234.968,
    "end": 237.169,
    "zh": "曼彻斯特或者其他北方城市",
    "zh_hant": "曼徹斯特或者其他北方城市"
  },
  {
    "index": 94,
    "text": "it's probably better to get the train",
    "start": 237.849,
    "end": 240.311,
    "zh": "最好坐火车",
    "zh_hant": "最好坐火車"
  },
  {
    "index": 95,
    "text": "because it's faster and I really like trains.",
    "start": 240.431,
    "end": 243.472,
    "zh": "因为更快，而且我真的很喜欢火车",
    "zh_hant": "因為更快，而且我真的很喜歡火車"
  },
  {
    "index": 96,
    "text": "You can relax.",
    "start": 243.122,
    "end": 244.333,
    "zh": "你可以放松",
    "zh_hant": "你可以放鬆"
  },
  {
    "index": 97,
    "text": "It's a relaxing experience.",
    "start": 244.093,
    "end": 246.314,
    "zh": "那是种放松的体验",
    "zh_hant": "那是种放松的體驗"
  },
  {
    "index": 98,
    "text": "Some of my best travel experiences",
    "start": 246.394,
    "end": 249.515,
    "zh": "我一些最好的旅行经历",
    "zh_hant": "我一些最好的旅行經歷"
  },
  {
    "index": 99,
    "text": "have been on long distance trains.",
    "start": 249.576,
    "end": 252.117,
    "zh": "就是在长途火车上",
    "zh_hant": "就是在長途火車上"
  },
  {
    "index": 100,
    "text": "Yeah?",
    "start": 252.757,
    "end": 253.918,
    "zh": "是吗",
    "zh_hant": "是嗎"
  },
  {
    "index": 101,
    "text": "Can you...",
    "start": 253.978,
    "end": 254.718,
    "zh": "你能……",
    "zh_hant": "你能……"
  },
  {
    "index": 102,
    "text": "Where have you been that's been so fantastic on a train?",
    "start": 254.718,
    "end": 257.699,
    "zh": "你坐火车去过哪里，那么美好",
    "zh_hant": "你坐火車去過哪裡，那麼美好"
  },
  {
    "index": 103,
    "text": "Well, I once went",
    "start": 257.379,
    "end": 260.101,
    "zh": "有一次我坐火车",
    "zh_hant": "有一次我坐火車"
  },
  {
    "index": 104,
    "text": "from Prague to Moscow on a train.",
    "start": 259.751,
    "end": 262.322,
    "zh": "从布拉格到莫斯科",
    "zh_hant": "從布拉格到莫斯科"
  },
  {
    "index": 105,
    "text": "Wow.",
    "start": 261.972,
    "end": 262.802,
    "zh": "哇",
    "zh_hant": "哇"
  },
  {
    "index": 106,
    "text": "Yeah.",
    "start": 263.162,
    "end": 263.802,
    "zh": "是的",
    "zh_hant": "是的"
  },
  {
    "index": 107,
    "text": "What was that like?",
    "start": 263.502,
    "end": 264.743,
    "zh": "那感觉怎么样",
    "zh_hant": "那感覺怎麼樣"
  },
  {
    "index": 108,
    "text": "Really exciting.",
    "start": 264.943,
    "end": 266.604,
    "zh": "非常刺激",
    "zh_hant": "非常刺激"
  },
  {
    "index": 109,
    "text": "Why?",
    "start": 266.564,
    "end": 267.324,
    "zh": "为什么",
    "zh_hant": "為什麼"
  },
  {
    "index": 110,
    "text": "It took about three days,",
    "start": 267.865,
    "end": 269.965,
    "zh": "大概花了三天",
    "zh_hant": "大概花了三天"
  },
  {
    "index": 111,
    "text": "and I was with some friends,",
    "start": 270.186,
    "end": 272.807,
    "zh": "我和一些朋友一起",
    "zh_hant": "我和一些朋友一起"
  },
  {
    "index": 112,
    "text": "and we could eat and drink and look out the window.",
    "start": 272.827,
    "end": 275.528,
    "zh": "可以吃喝，看窗外",
    "zh_hant": "可以吃喝，看窗外"
  },
  {
    "index": 113,
    "text": "The landscape changed frequently.",
    "start": 275.488,
    "end": 277.849,
    "zh": "风景不断变化",
    "zh_hant": "風景不斷變化"
  },
  {
    "index": 114,
    "text": "It was just exciting.",
    "start": 278.35,
    "end": 279.65,
    "zh": "真的很刺激",
    "zh_hant": "真的很刺激"
  },
  {
    "index": 115,
    "text": "We had",
    "start": 288.955,
    "end": 291.977,
    "zh": "我们听到了",
    "zh_hant": "我們聽到了"
  },
  {
    "index": 116,
    "text": "reliable",
    "start": 299.21,
    "end": 300.39,
    "zh": "可靠",
    "zh_hant": "可靠"
  },
  {
    "index": 117,
    "text": ", which describes something you can trust,",
    "start": 300.04,
    "end": 303.082,
    "zh": "意思是你可以信任的东西",
    "zh_hant": "意思是你可以信任的東西"
  },
  {
    "index": 118,
    "text": "and unreliable which describes something you can't trust.",
    "start": 302.962,
    "end": 306.704,
    "zh": "还有不可靠，意思是不能信任的东西",
    "zh_hant": "還有不可靠，意思是不能信任的東西"
  },
  {
    "index": 119,
    "text": "We heard frequent , which describes something that happens",
    "start": 306.904,
    "end": 311.286,
    "zh": "我们听到了频繁，意思是发生",
    "zh_hant": "我們聽到了頻繁，意思是發生"
  },
  {
    "index": 120,
    "text": "often.",
    "start": 311.006,
    "end": 311.786,
    "zh": "次数很多",
    "zh_hant": "次數很多"
  },
  {
    "index": 121,
    "text": "And we also heard delayed , which means something,",
    "start": 312.307,
    "end": 315.868,
    "zh": "我们还听到了延误，意思是某个东西",
    "zh_hant": "我們還聽到了延誤，意思是某個東西"
  },
  {
    "index": 122,
    "text": "like public transport, comes later than expected.",
    "start": 315.518,
    "end": 318.89,
    "zh": "比如公共交通，比预期来得晚",
    "zh_hant": "比如公共交通，比預期來得晚"
  },
  {
    "index": 123,
    "text": "That's it for this episode of Real Easy English.",
    "start": 319.031,
    "end": 322.155,
    "zh": "这期《简单英语》就到这里了",
    "zh_hant": "這期《簡單英語》就到這裡了"
  },
  {
    "index": 124,
    "text": "Don't forget to go to our website where you can get a free worksheet",
    "start": 321.835,
    "end": 326.001,
    "zh": "别忘了访问我们的网站，可以免费下载工作表",
    "zh_hant": "別忘了訪問我們的網站，可以免費下載工作表"
  },
  {
    "index": 125,
    "text": "to download to test what you've learnt.",
    "start": 325.651,
    "end": 327.943,
    "zh": "测试你学到的内容",
    "zh_hant": "測試你學到的內容"
  },
  {
    "index": 126,
    "text": "It's at bbclearningenglish.com.",
    "start": 328.124,
    "end": 330.126,
    "zh": "网址是bbclearningenglish.com",
    "zh_hant": "網址是bbclearningenglish.com"
  },
  {
    "index": 127,
    "text": "Next time, we're talking about different times of year.",
    "start": 329.776,
    "end": 331.468,
    "zh": "下期我们聊不同的季节",
    "zh_hant": "下期我們聊不同的季節"
  },
  {
    "index": 128,
    "text": "Spring, summer, autumn and winter.",
    "start": 331.118,
    "end": 332.129,
    "zh": "春天、夏天、秋天和冬天",
    "zh_hant": "春天、夏天、秋天和冬天"
  },
  {
    "index": 129,
    "text": "See you then.",
    "start": 331.779,
    "end": 332.39,
    "zh": "到时候见",
    "zh_hant": "到時候見"
  },
  {
    "index": 130,
    "text": "Goodbye.",
    "start": 332.04,
    "end": 332.55,
    "zh": "再见",
    "zh_hant": "再見"
  },
  {
    "index": 131,
    "text": "Bye.",
    "start": 332.2,
    "end": 332.63,
    "zh": "拜",
    "zh_hant": "拜"
  }
]
